<title>JAPAN: Nichias -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nichias -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 56.12		vs	   54.47</p>
<p> Operating	    1.91		vs	    1.39</p>
<p> Current		1.61		vs	  905    million</p>
<p> Net		  765    million    vs	  417    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.66 yen	  vs	    3.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    135 million	  vs	 131 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nichias Corp is a manufacturer of ceramic construction materials.</p>
</text>
